        "original_id": "b5a8bf5f-248b-51b7-ad5e-49402da5e226",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ellis Ferreira, Boris Becker, Rick Leach, Corina Morariu, Galbraith\n- Events: 2000 Australian Open, 2001 Australian Open, 1997 Stockholm Open – Doubles\n- Roles: professional tennis players\n- Topics: Grand Slam doubles titles, year-end championships, Masters Series titles, Olympic doubles gold medal\n\nFacts:\n- Ellis Ferreira and Rick Leach won the men's doubles title at the 2000 Australian Open.\n- Ellis Ferreira and Corina Morariu won the mixed doubles title at the 2001 Australian Open.\n- Ellis Ferreira won two Grand Slam doubles titles in total.\n- In the 1997 Stockholm Open doubles event, Galbraith partnered with Ellis Ferreira and lost in the final.\n- Boris Franz Becker was born on 22 November 1967 and is a German former professional tennis player.\n- Boris Becker was ranked world No. 1 during his professional tennis career.\n- Boris Becker won five year-end championships, 13 Masters Series titles, and an Olympic gold medal in doubles.",
